       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FLTHRU01.
       AUTHOR. SYNTHETIC-CORPUS.
      * CATEGORY D: LEGACY ANTI-PATTERNS - PERFORM THRU AND FALLTHROUGH CONTROL FLOW
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FLOW-METRICS.
           05  STEP-A-HIT-COUNT    PIC 9(3) VALUE 000.
           05  STEP-B-HIT-COUNT    PIC 9(3) VALUE 000.
           05  STEP-C-HIT-COUNT    PIC 9(3) VALUE 000.
           05  PASS-THRU-STATUS    PIC X(12) VALUE 'INITIAL'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-CONTROL.
           PERFORM 1000-STAGE-ALPHA THRU 3000-STAGE-GAMMA
           MOVE 'COMPLETED' TO PASS-THRU-STATUS
           GOBACK.

       1000-STAGE-ALPHA.
           ADD 1 TO STEP-A-HIT-COUNT.

       2000-STAGE-BETA.
           ADD 1 TO STEP-B-HIT-COUNT
           IF STEP-A-HIT-COUNT = 0
               MOVE 'SKIPPED-ALPHA' TO PASS-THRU-STATUS
           END-IF.

       3000-STAGE-GAMMA.
           ADD 1 TO STEP-C-HIT-COUNT.
